	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nqXq4-dffnOtiH9Hb",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 22, DX 10, IQ 4, HT 13, HP 22, WILL 8, PER 8, FP 13, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 7, DODGE 8, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
